2. EWS ResponseCode names
-------------------------

The file tests/data/response_codes.txt contains a selection of 65
enumeration names of the Exchange Web Services "ResponseCode" element
(ResponseCodeType), for example "NoError" and "ErrorItemNotFound". It is used
by the test-suite to verify that the server only emits valid code names.

    Exchange Web Services reference: ResponseCode
    Source:
    https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/exchange/client-developer/web-service-reference/responsecode
    Retrieved: 2026-11-04

This is not an Open Specifications document. The list contains
protocol identifiers (names) only, without any descriptive text. Copyright
in the original documentation remains with Microsoft.


